# Working documents

At the start of a session, read these repo-root files before changing code:

- `rule.md` — confirmed implementation rules
- `planning.md` — current plan and unresolved decisions
- `tasks.md` — task status and evidence

`AGENTS.md` remains the always-applied workspace rule. Do not copy it into these files. If a working document disagrees with the code, trust the code and update the working document.
